  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ss_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -304
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Stippled sphere\n\nA grey sphere and its shadow are drawn, then Rasterized into an image. Scatter in `stipple` mode places `count` points with a density that follows the image's darkness (stretched over the area; `invert` for light), then relaxes them by weighted Lloyd passes (`relax`): Secord's stippling. `gamma` > 1 deepens the contrast.\n\nAny image works: a photo, a camera frame, text.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Stippled sphere\n\nA grey sphere and its shadow are drawn, then Rasterized into an image. Scatter in `stipple` mode places `count` points with a density that follows the image's darkness (stretched over the area; `invert` for light), then relaxes them by weighted Lloyd passes (`relax`): Secord's stippling. `gamma` > 1 deepens the contrast.\n\nAny image works: a photo, a camera frame, text.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 240
      }
    },
